## Open Questions

1. **Save trigger**: Should annotations be saved automatically (e.g., on document close / app backgrounding), or should we add an explicit "Save" button to the reader toolbar?
2. **Existing PDF annotations**: When re-opening a PDF that already has embedded annotations from a previous session, should we load those back into the in-memory overlay so the eraser can still remove them? (This is significantly more complex and could be a Phase 2.)

