### Data Layer — `PdfAnnotationWriterImpl`

#### [NEW] [PdfAnnotationWriterImpl.kt](file:///x:/AI_and_Automation/pdf-reader/app/src/main/java/com/pdfreader/app/data/pdfbox/PdfAnnotationWriterImpl.kt)

Implements `PdfAnnotationSaver`. Internally:
1. Loads a fresh `PDDocument` from the byte array.
2. For each page with annotations, calls the writer methods from `PdfAnnotationWriter`.
3. Saves the `PDDocument` to the output file.
4. Closes the document.

