#### [MODIFY] [PdfReaderViewModel.kt](file:///x:/AI_and_Automation/pdf-reader/app/src/main/java/com/pdfreader/app/presentation/mvi/PdfReaderViewModel.kt)

- Accept `PdfAnnotationSaver` as a new constructor parameter.
- Handle `SaveAnnotations` intent:
  1. Set `isSavingAnnotations = true`.
  2. Get raw PDF bytes from `pdfEngine.getPdfBytes()`.
  3. Call `annotationSaver.saveAnnotations(...)` with the current state maps, writing to a temp file in `cacheDir`.
  4. Call `syncManager.syncBackToSource(openedUri, tempFile)` to push the annotated PDF back to source.
  5. Clear the in-memory annotation maps (since they're now embedded).
  6. Re-open the document from the URI so the rendered bitmaps include the embedded annotations.
  7. Set `isSavingAnnotations = false`.

