## Flow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as PdfReaderScreen
    participant VM as PdfReaderViewModel
    participant Saver as PdfAnnotationWriterImpl
    participant Sync as SafPdfSyncManager
    participant SAF as Source (Drive/Local)

    User->>UI: Taps "Save" button
    UI->>VM: SaveAnnotations intent
    VM->>VM: Get pdfBytes from PdfEngine
    VM->>Saver: saveAnnotations(bytes, strokes, highlights, notes, tempFile)
    Saver->>Saver: Load PDDocument from bytes
    Saver->>Saver: Write PDAnnotationTextMarkup (highlights)
    Saver->>Saver: Write PDAnnotationInk (pen strokes)
    Saver->>Saver: Write PDAnnotationText (sticky notes)
    Saver->>Saver: Save PDDocument to tempFile
    Saver-->>VM: Return tempFile
    VM->>Sync: syncBackToSource(uri, tempFile)
    Sync->>SAF: Write via SAF OutputStream
    SAF-->>Sync: Success
    Sync-->>VM: true
    VM->>VM: Clear annotation maps, re-open document
    VM-->>UI: Updated state (annotations now in bitmap)
```

